1
00:00:10,524 --> 00:00:14,193
[SOOBIN / YEONJUN]

2
00:00:18,852 --> 00:00:25,420
[SOOBIN]

3
00:00:30,735 --> 00:00:32,916
It’s hot in here.

4
00:00:34,015 --> 00:00:35,136
[SOOBIN’s voice]

5
00:00:39,112 --> 00:00:41,054
Found you, SOOBIN.

6
00:00:42,954 --> 00:00:43,835
Please don’t do this.

7
00:00:47,685 --> 00:00:49,331
[YEONJUN swallows nervously]

8
00:00:49,332 --> 00:00:52,589
[SOOBIN]

9
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:57,690
The two biggest scaredy-cats got caught first.

10
00:00:58,204 --> 00:00:59,734
It’s hot.

11
00:01:01,466 --> 00:01:04,343
We can use the members’ phone numbers to ask for help.

12
00:01:05,202 --> 00:01:05,984
Oh!

13
00:01:05,985 --> 00:01:07,979
Or we can escape on our own.

14
00:01:07,980 --> 00:01:08,797
If we have a key!

15
00:01:08,798 --> 00:01:10,723
– I have a key!
– Oh! Then you go.

16
00:01:10,724 --> 00:01:11,698
You go.

17
00:01:13,763 --> 00:01:15,554
I don’t want to go...

18
00:01:16,504 --> 00:01:18,463
[Phone notification sound]

19
00:01:18,716 --> 00:01:21,995
[A member has been caught]

20
00:01:21,996 --> 00:01:25,018
I’ll go rescue them.

21
00:01:26,758 --> 00:01:31,171
[BEOMGYU heads to the jail]

22
00:01:40,339 --> 00:01:41,614
A member?

23
00:01:42,130 --> 00:01:43,979
[Someone arrives at the jail before BEOMGYU]

24
00:01:44,453 --> 00:01:45,339
You go out instead of me.

25
00:01:45,340 --> 00:01:46,363
It’s YEONJUN.

26
00:01:46,364 --> 00:01:47,446
YEONJUN, do you have a key?

27
00:01:48,548 --> 00:01:51,024
[The key from HUENINGKAI]
Then give me one

28
00:01:51,025 --> 00:01:52,372
and just run.

29
00:01:52,373 --> 00:01:54,450
Can’t we go together? I’m really scared.

30
00:01:55,054 --> 00:01:56,553
I want to stop now.

31
00:01:56,690 --> 00:01:57,852
I’m so scared.

32
00:01:58,550 --> 00:02:01,605
[After handing over the key, he leaves the jail]

33
00:02:02,051 --> 00:02:05,243
[HUENINGKAI is still inside the coffin]

34
00:02:05,244 --> 00:02:06,470
[HUENINGKAI]

35
00:02:06,471 --> 00:02:07,620
I’m sweating.

36
00:02:09,282 --> 00:02:10,562
I’m sweating.

37
00:02:12,471 --> 00:02:14,332
It’s so hot I feel like I’m dying.

38
00:02:16,714 --> 00:02:19,563
[HUENINGKAI]

39
00:02:20,921 --> 00:02:25,067
[BEOMGYU heads to the jail with two keys]

40
00:02:39,450 --> 00:02:41,010
It’s hot!

41
00:02:41,296 --> 00:02:43,818
[HUENINGKAI / BEOMGYU]
Seriously!

42
00:02:44,855 --> 00:02:46,226
Huh?

43
00:02:49,749 --> 00:02:50,971
(Shh) Hey!

44
00:02:52,250 --> 00:02:53,179
Let’s go rescue the others.

45
00:02:53,180 --> 00:02:54,022
Let’s go!

46
00:02:54,023 --> 00:02:55,690
I almost died from the heat.

47
00:02:56,642 --> 00:02:58,020
I hid well.

48
00:02:58,021 --> 00:02:59,245
I hid back there with a mannequin.

49
00:02:59,333 --> 00:03:01,512
– Let’s go!
– Where’s the jail? I don’t know the way.

50
00:03:01,513 --> 00:03:02,382
I’ll go first.

51
00:03:02,383 --> 00:03:03,770
I think it’s this way.

52
00:03:06,664 --> 00:03:08,650
[Sound of something falling]

53
00:03:09,290 --> 00:03:13,356
[The seeker was nearby]

54
00:03:13,357 --> 00:03:16,699
[The seeker turns toward the sound]

55
00:03:23,997 --> 00:03:24,865
YEONJUN, you have a key, right?

56
00:03:24,866 --> 00:03:26,385
– Yeah!
– Let’s go.

57
00:03:29,388 --> 00:03:30,344
We’ve been spotted.

58
00:03:39,757 --> 00:03:40,822
YEONJUN! Give me the key!

59
00:03:41,860 --> 00:03:43,639
[Seeker lets out a scream]

60
00:03:47,465 --> 00:03:49,610
Found you, BEOMGYU!

61
00:03:51,352 --> 00:03:52,823
But we kind of smell like our own kind.

62
00:03:52,824 --> 00:03:54,315
Right?

63
00:03:54,316 --> 00:03:57,425
[BEOMGYU]

64
00:03:57,845 --> 00:03:59,191
Where’s the key?

65
00:03:59,192 --> 00:04:00,879
The key broke?

66
00:04:03,342 --> 00:04:04,936
The key...

67
00:04:05,306 --> 00:04:08,053
[BEOMGYU throws two keys just before getting caught]

68
00:04:09,533 --> 00:04:11,837
Found it!

69
00:04:16,510 --> 00:04:18,897
I have presents for you guys.

70
00:04:19,411 --> 00:04:21,096
[One key is passed from BEOMGYU]

71
00:04:21,416 --> 00:04:24,147
[TOMORROW X TOGETHER has found 4 out of 5 keys]

72
00:04:24,380 --> 00:04:26,556
Then I’m going to hide in the spot I started in.

73
00:04:26,557 --> 00:04:27,473
I can’t do this anymore.

74
00:04:27,474 --> 00:04:28,938
I seriously can’t do anything right now.

75
00:04:29,577 --> 00:04:31,331
[YEONJUN returns to the jail]

76
00:04:31,585 --> 00:04:34,022
[Hands the last key to HUENINGKAI]

77
00:04:34,958 --> 00:04:36,276
KAI, let’s go together!

78
00:04:37,207 --> 00:04:38,865
– Let’s go together, let’s go together.
– Okay.

79
00:04:40,429 --> 00:04:41,966
– So we just have to hold out now?
– We have to endure.

80
00:04:45,038 --> 00:04:47,419
Then are we supposed to keep finding keys

81
00:04:47,420 --> 00:04:50,653
and use them to escape as many times as we can?

82
00:04:50,983 --> 00:04:53,090
Or if we just hold out till the end, we win, right?

83
00:04:53,091 --> 00:04:54,603
Yeah! If more than half survive.

84
00:04:54,604 --> 00:04:56,362
We’re screwed, huh?

85
00:04:56,363 --> 00:04:58,836
No, we all have keys. If we get out, we’re good.

86
00:04:58,974 --> 00:05:00,948
I’m gonna rest here for like five minutes.

87
00:05:00,949 --> 00:05:03,284
This place is so peaceful.

88
00:05:03,285 --> 00:05:05,345
Want this (mask)? Do you want to wear it around?

89
00:05:06,235 --> 00:05:09,454
I feel like I’d get scared seeing myself in the mirror.

90
00:05:09,664 --> 00:05:12,435
[The two return to the building]

91
00:05:13,447 --> 00:05:14,644
There’s actually a decent hiding spot.

92
00:05:14,645 --> 00:05:16,149
There’s a place with CCTV.

93
00:05:16,530 --> 00:05:17,333
Should we just go there instead?

94
00:05:17,334 --> 00:05:18,851
– The one upstairs earlier?
– The CCTV room.

95
00:05:19,293 --> 00:05:21,254
We can track the seeker’s path from there.

96
00:05:22,459 --> 00:05:24,976
[Sound of the seeker’s footsteps]

97
00:05:25,155 --> 00:05:27,290
[The seeker comes down the stairs]

98
00:05:36,634 --> 00:05:39,754
[Then goes back up and enters a room on the 2nd floor]

99
00:05:44,081 --> 00:05:45,589
Here again...

100
00:05:48,997 --> 00:05:50,915
My personal spot.

101
00:05:51,778 --> 00:05:53,210
This spot is the best.

102
00:06:03,686 --> 00:06:06,223
I actually want to go to the 2nd floor.

103
00:06:07,323 --> 00:06:10,743
There’s a CCTV there.

104
00:06:11,090 --> 00:06:13,934
[The seeker is standing right in front of the CCTV]

105
00:06:30,279 --> 00:06:31,858
Should I take a quick look at the CCTV first?

106
00:06:35,813 --> 00:06:40,435
Found you, HUENINGKAI.

107
00:06:40,436 --> 00:06:42,387
Seriously...

108
00:06:42,388 --> 00:06:43,915
I was just trying to check the CCTV.

109
00:06:43,916 --> 00:06:47,619
[HUENINGKAI]

110
00:06:48,893 --> 00:06:50,699
What do I do... I really don’t want to leave.

111
00:06:51,943 --> 00:06:53,107
Hold on.

112
00:06:53,108 --> 00:06:54,576
I’m gonna rest two more minutes.

113
00:06:54,577 --> 00:06:56,012
[Phone notification sound]

114
00:06:57,418 --> 00:06:59,496
It says someone got caught. Who was it?

115
00:06:59,497 --> 00:07:01,097
Someone got caught again?

116
00:07:01,098 --> 00:07:02,301
Then I should get out now.

117
00:07:02,302 --> 00:07:03,498
Someone’s coming. Who is it?

118
00:07:03,499 --> 00:07:04,478
Did you come to rescue me?

119
00:07:04,479 --> 00:07:06,292
No, I got caught too.

120
00:07:10,056 --> 00:07:11,667
TAEHYUN, how much time do you have left to escape?

121
00:07:11,668 --> 00:07:13,789
– I have 2 minutes.
– 2 minutes left?

122
00:07:13,790 --> 00:07:15,466
Everyone has a key, right?

123
00:07:15,467 --> 00:07:16,265
I don’t have one.

124
00:07:16,266 --> 00:07:17,153
You don’t?

125
00:07:17,154 --> 00:07:18,676
You had a spare key earlier.

126
00:07:18,677 --> 00:07:20,036
I gave that one to YEONJUN.

127
00:07:20,037 --> 00:07:22,040
Oh no...

128
00:07:22,165 --> 00:07:24,817
[YEONJUN]

129
00:07:25,371 --> 00:07:27,120
Everyone,

130
00:07:27,121 --> 00:07:28,710
I don’t think I can ever do something like this again.

131
00:07:28,711 --> 00:07:32,167
This is seriously not something humans should do.

132
00:07:33,193 --> 00:07:38,292
[YEONJUN is the only one still surviving]

133
00:08:06,750 --> 00:08:11,029
[He heads back toward the jail]

134
00:08:11,879 --> 00:08:13,475
Why is he coming back again?

135
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,395
Get out.

136
00:08:15,396 --> 00:08:16,298
Hurry up and get out.

137
00:08:16,299 --> 00:08:18,968
YEONJUN, don’t you need to leave so you get more screen time?

138
00:08:19,492 --> 00:08:20,925
I can’t do this alone.

139
00:08:21,575 --> 00:08:22,965
You two will be out again soon anyway.

140
00:08:23,148 --> 00:08:24,116
TAEHYUN, just go.

141
00:08:24,711 --> 00:08:26,823
[TAEHYUN escapes from jail]

142
00:08:26,913 --> 00:08:28,574
Bye then.

143
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:31,128
Wait, hang on.

144
00:08:31,129 --> 00:08:32,595
Let me just give you this.

145
00:08:33,216 --> 00:08:36,424
[YEONJUN returns the key to HUENINGKAI]

146
00:08:36,794 --> 00:08:39,466
– But what are we supposed to do now?
– We just have to hide.

147
00:08:39,467 --> 00:08:40,212
Just hold out.

148
00:08:40,212 --> 00:08:41,354
We just have to last until the time’s up.

149
00:08:41,355 --> 00:08:42,097
Really?

150
00:08:42,422 --> 00:08:44,730
I seriously want to quit now.

151
00:08:44,845 --> 00:08:46,371
[YEONJUN / TAEHYUN]

152
00:08:46,372 --> 00:08:47,997
Hide, hide!

153
00:08:54,514 --> 00:08:55,430
TAEHYUN!

154
00:08:56,193 --> 00:08:57,222
TAEHYUN!

155
00:08:57,916 --> 00:08:59,152
I’ll hide here.

156
00:08:59,819 --> 00:09:00,892
Where are you?

157
00:09:01,605 --> 00:09:03,012
– Are you there?
– Yeah!

158
00:09:04,314 --> 00:09:05,571
Stay hidden!

159
00:09:10,207 --> 00:09:11,504
I’m over here.

160
00:09:11,574 --> 00:09:13,209
This spot feels the safest.

161
00:09:15,313 --> 00:09:16,765
I’m going out now.

162
00:09:17,619 --> 00:09:20,154
[SOOBIN escapes from jail]

163
00:09:26,361 --> 00:09:27,814
[SOOBIN sighs]

164
00:09:35,353 --> 00:09:38,252
[He escaped, but can’t easily go back in]

165
00:09:39,751 --> 00:09:41,205
Let’s go!

166
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:50,810
[SOOBIN]

167
00:09:51,394 --> 00:09:52,642
KAI, how many minutes do you have left?

168
00:09:52,643 --> 00:09:54,118
I have 10.

169
00:09:54,119 --> 00:09:55,673
You’re staying 10 more minutes, right?

170
00:09:55,799 --> 00:09:56,339
To use up as much time as possible.

171
00:09:56,340 --> 00:09:57,868
Or should I leave with you?

172
00:09:57,869 --> 00:09:58,732
I’m fine either way.

173
00:09:58,733 --> 00:09:59,658
I don’t mind.

174
00:09:59,659 --> 00:10:01,423
[Phone notification sound]

175
00:10:07,172 --> 00:10:11,885
When 2,222 seconds remain, the seeker disappears

176
00:10:11,886 --> 00:10:16,616
and you’ll get 4 minutes to hide better.

177
00:10:17,088 --> 00:10:19,450
The 4 minutes begin when the hide-and-seek song plays

178
00:10:19,451 --> 00:10:22,950
and you can’t rescue caught members during that time.

179
00:10:23,292 --> 00:10:27,206
After 4 minutes, the number of seekers doubles

180
00:10:27,581 --> 00:10:30,110
so hide even more carefully.

181
00:10:30,334 --> 00:10:32,025
– Then I should leave now.
– Yeah, go.

182
00:10:34,141 --> 00:10:35,757
[All 4 keys used, everyone escapes]

183
00:10:42,241 --> 00:10:43,820
[The seeker disappears]

184
00:10:44,204 --> 00:10:47,354
[Free time: 4 minutes]

185
00:10:48,221 --> 00:10:50,169
But where do we hide now?

186
00:10:50,927 --> 00:10:53,561
I almost died. The seeker was right next to me.

187
00:10:53,562 --> 00:10:54,470
But isn’t this kind of fun?

188
00:10:54,471 --> 00:10:55,802
I seriously want to quit.

189
00:10:55,803 --> 00:10:57,131
We have to hide for 20 more minutes.

190
00:10:57,609 --> 00:10:58,203
Hide for 20 more minutes?

191
00:10:58,204 --> 00:10:59,456
And now there are two seekers.

192
00:10:59,457 --> 00:11:00,525
YEONJUN, you’ve never been caught?

193
00:11:00,526 --> 00:11:02,231
– Not once.
– Whoa, that’s impressive.

194
00:11:02,499 --> 00:11:03,577
I’m seriously so exhausted.

195
00:11:03,578 --> 00:11:04,806
Are there even any hiding spots left?

196
00:11:04,807 --> 00:11:06,494
I’m mentally drained.

197
00:11:06,968 --> 00:11:08,506
I mean it.

198
00:11:09,375 --> 00:11:10,746
This is way too unfair for us.

199
00:11:10,747 --> 00:11:12,239
If three people get caught, it’s over.

200
00:11:12,414 --> 00:11:14,134
Hey, wait up! Guys, let’s stick together.

201
00:11:14,135 --> 00:11:17,846
[Time left until seekers reappear]

202
00:11:17,847 --> 00:11:18,884
[TAEHYUN]

203
00:11:18,885 --> 00:11:20,608
Hide well.

204
00:11:20,609 --> 00:11:24,264
[1F / TAEHYUN]

205
00:11:24,265 --> 00:11:28,194
[1F / TAEHYUN / BEOMGYU]

206
00:11:32,703 --> 00:11:34,350
[BEOMGYU hides inside a refrigerator]

207
00:11:35,375 --> 00:11:39,373
[1F / TAEHYUN / BEOMGYU]

208
00:11:39,563 --> 00:11:41,700
[YEONJUN, SOOBIN, and HUENINGKAI head to the basement]

209
00:11:42,663 --> 00:11:43,786
Oh wait

210
00:11:46,324 --> 00:11:48,083
I can just hide here.

211
00:11:49,356 --> 00:11:51,045
This spot’s not bad.

212
00:11:51,546 --> 00:11:52,984
I’ll just hide like this.

213
00:11:53,350 --> 00:11:55,199
Guys, hide well.

214
00:11:56,805 --> 00:11:58,429
This is honestly too much.

215
00:11:59,091 --> 00:12:02,053
It might actually be better to get caught early.

216
00:12:02,595 --> 00:12:04,919
From SOOBIN’s perspective, this place will be less shocking.

217
00:12:05,042 --> 00:12:06,955
[HUENINGKAI gives up the hiding spot for SOOBIN]

218
00:12:07,108 --> 00:12:08,501
Thanks. I’ll try staying here.

219
00:12:08,502 --> 00:12:09,357
Then I’ll go find a new spot, okay?

220
00:12:09,358 --> 00:12:10,564
Try to hide well.

221
00:12:10,565 --> 00:12:12,290
Let’s survive and see each other again.

222
00:12:14,562 --> 00:12:16,401
We don’t have much time.

223
00:12:16,402 --> 00:12:20,219
[Time left until seekers reappear]

224
00:12:20,468 --> 00:12:21,864
[SOOBIN]

225
00:12:21,865 --> 00:12:24,134
I think I might be visible.

226
00:12:29,699 --> 00:12:31,779
I’m lying flat on the ground.

227
00:12:32,579 --> 00:12:36,484
[YEONJUN moves up to the machine room on 1F]

228
00:12:36,485 --> 00:12:41,728
[1F / YEONJUN]

229
00:12:42,722 --> 00:12:46,480
This is harder than any other variety show I’ve ever done.

230
00:12:47,329 --> 00:12:49,240
This is seriously terrifying.

231
00:12:52,439 --> 00:12:54,811
[Hide-and-seek resumes notification sound]

232
00:13:05,449 --> 00:13:09,173
Ready or not

233
00:13:09,439 --> 00:13:13,222
your hair might show.

234
00:13:17,639 --> 00:13:21,226
Ready or not

235
00:13:21,576 --> 00:13:25,726
your clothes might show.

236
00:13:26,997 --> 00:13:30,828
Ready or not

237
00:13:31,741 --> 00:13:36,823
there are two seekers now.

238
00:13:37,142 --> 00:13:41,458
There are two seekers.

239
00:13:43,627 --> 00:13:46,380
There are two of them now.

240
00:13:46,956 --> 00:13:51,098
There’s really no hiding spot on the 3rd or 4th floor.

241
00:13:51,778 --> 00:13:54,110
Is everyone hidden?

242
00:13:54,111 --> 00:13:56,999
Here I come again.

243
00:13:57,669 --> 00:14:01,679
[Hide-and-seek resumes]

244
00:14:03,089 --> 00:14:05,178
This is so scary.

245
00:14:09,651 --> 00:14:12,200
[B1 / SOOBIN]

246
00:14:12,614 --> 00:14:17,793
I don’t even watch horror movies.

247
00:14:17,794 --> 00:14:21,034
I’ve never been to a haunted house, even as a kid.

248
00:14:21,035 --> 00:14:23,715
I have zero tolerance for scary stuff.

249
00:14:26,031 --> 00:14:28,587
And now they’ve made me do this.

250
00:14:29,513 --> 00:14:31,311
The seeker hasn’t come to the basement.

251
00:14:32,064 --> 00:14:33,645
Did I hide well?

252
00:14:44,049 --> 00:14:44,738
[SOOBIN]

253
00:14:44,739 --> 00:14:46,518
[Sound of knocking]

254
00:14:47,693 --> 00:14:49,085
The seeker’s coming.

255
00:14:50,006 --> 00:14:52,807
[Sound of the seeker’s footsteps]

256
00:15:04,590 --> 00:15:06,972
[The seeker misses SOOBIN and goes upstairs]

257
00:15:10,531 --> 00:15:12,569
[4F / HUENINGKAI]

258
00:15:12,570 --> 00:15:14,008
What can I do...

259
00:15:15,890 --> 00:15:19,123
[Sound of the seeker’s cane]

260
00:15:19,639 --> 00:15:21,558
I’m doomed.

261
00:15:25,731 --> 00:15:30,612
[HUENINGKAI]

262
00:15:43,712 --> 00:15:47,292
[Sound of the seeker’s footsteps]

263
00:16:15,254 --> 00:16:18,149
[Sound of knocking]

264
00:16:36,445 --> 00:16:38,973
Found you! HUENINGKAI.

265
00:16:38,974 --> 00:16:41,276
This is just too much.

266
00:16:41,277 --> 00:16:43,254
Why’d you come here right away?

267
00:16:43,255 --> 00:16:46,539
[HUENINGKAI]

268
00:16:46,921 --> 00:16:49,824
I got caught this fast?

269
00:16:52,607 --> 00:16:56,561
[1F / TAEHYUN / BEOMGYU]

270
00:16:56,746 --> 00:17:00,897
[BEOMGYU]

271
00:17:02,477 --> 00:17:04,435
[Sound of the seeker’s cane]

272
00:17:10,800 --> 00:17:14,069
[BEOMGYU]

273
00:17:26,798 --> 00:17:30,295
[The seeker’s cane grows louder]

274
00:17:47,773 --> 00:17:49,309
Found you! BEOMGYU.

275
00:17:49,310 --> 00:17:51,951
[BEOMGYU]

276
00:17:52,186 --> 00:17:53,837
[Phone vibration sound]

277
00:17:54,952 --> 00:17:57,646
Two members are currently captured.

278
00:17:58,089 --> 00:17:59,238
[Phone notification sound]

279
00:18:01,799 --> 00:18:04,650
“I want to die 6617.”

280
00:18:04,651 --> 00:18:07,025
That’s SOOBIN, right?

281
00:18:08,925 --> 00:18:11,008
[Phone notification sound]

282
00:18:17,051 --> 00:18:20,011
[“Then go ahead and die”]

283
00:18:20,561 --> 00:18:23,015
[Current survival rate: 60%]

284
00:18:23,850 --> 00:18:25,534
[Phone vibration sound]

285
00:18:26,587 --> 00:18:28,716
Final key hint.

286
00:18:29,122 --> 00:18:31,539
[Key hint]

287
00:18:31,540 --> 00:18:33,266
[Phone notification sound]

288
00:18:33,544 --> 00:18:35,675
[Key hint]
Final key hint?

289
00:18:36,651 --> 00:18:39,864
Oh, I’ve seen this before. Where was it?

290
00:18:40,540 --> 00:18:43,668
2nd floor... I think it was on the 2nd floor.

291
00:18:44,117 --> 00:18:45,976
[Phone notification sound]

292
00:18:46,188 --> 00:18:47,771
Final key hint.

293
00:18:47,772 --> 00:18:50,820
[Key hint]

294
00:18:50,975 --> 00:18:53,418
Not looking.

295
00:18:53,419 --> 00:18:55,566
I’m too scared to go out. I’m not going.

296
00:18:55,567 --> 00:18:57,363
There are two seekers now.

297
00:19:02,776 --> 00:19:04,785
They’re coming. They’re coming.

298
00:19:04,976 --> 00:19:07,893
[1F / YEONJUN / Seeker]

299
00:19:11,611 --> 00:19:14,340
They’re coming.

300
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:16,327
[Seeker screams]

301
00:19:21,446 --> 00:19:23,642
I’m scared.

302
00:19:24,707 --> 00:19:31,428
[1F / YEONJUN / Seeker]

303
00:19:36,590 --> 00:19:39,188
[YEONJUN swallows nervously]

304
00:19:49,113 --> 00:19:52,226
This is too scary.

305
00:19:56,718 --> 00:20:00,527
[TAEHYUN]

306
00:20:00,528 --> 00:20:03,495
[1F / Seeker / TAEHYUN]

307
00:20:03,685 --> 00:20:05,468
[TAEHYUN]

308
00:20:05,661 --> 00:20:07,729
[TAEHYUN]

309
00:20:07,937 --> 00:20:09,954
[TAEHYUN]

310
00:20:10,781 --> 00:20:12,629
[Phone vibration sound]

311
00:20:14,803 --> 00:20:18,077
[1F / Seeker / TAEHYUN / The seeker hears the phone vibration]

312
00:20:20,365 --> 00:20:22,243
[TAEHYUN]

313
00:20:27,969 --> 00:20:30,742
Found you! TAEHYUN.

314
00:20:32,376 --> 00:20:35,136
You actually found me...

315
00:20:35,137 --> 00:20:36,457
I was pretty well hidden.

316
00:20:37,769 --> 00:20:41,052
I held out through mosquito bites just to get MOA a gift.

317
00:20:41,053 --> 00:20:43,638
[TAEHYUN]

318
00:20:43,850 --> 00:20:45,174
If three of us are caught

319
00:20:45,175 --> 00:20:47,429
then we’ve basically lost, right?

320
00:20:47,430 --> 00:20:48,093
Yeah.

321
00:20:48,094 --> 00:20:50,434
But if there’s 1 second left

322
00:20:50,435 --> 00:20:53,009
and someone uses a key to save someone, then it counts as a win.

323
00:20:53,010 --> 00:20:54,869
That would be a win.

324
00:20:55,184 --> 00:20:57,056
But this is way too hard.

325
00:20:57,282 --> 00:21:01,376
[Current survival rate 40%]

326
00:21:01,568 --> 00:21:06,715
[2 survivors / 1 key remaining]

327
00:21:06,733 --> 00:21:09,468
[YEONJUN / Hiding on the 1st floor]

328
00:21:09,857 --> 00:21:12,890
[Seeker sounds nearby]

329
00:21:18,414 --> 00:21:19,725
They’re here, they’re here.

330
00:21:23,824 --> 00:21:25,186
I’m scared.

331
00:21:29,539 --> 00:21:34,770
[YEONJUN]

332
00:21:37,151 --> 00:21:40,049
I’m seriously scared to death.

333
00:21:44,199 --> 00:21:47,784
This is way too scary.

334
00:21:52,828 --> 00:21:55,641
[YEONJUN swallows nervously]

335
00:21:55,861 --> 00:21:57,703
[Meanwhile, SOOBIN hiding in the basement]

336
00:22:00,051 --> 00:22:01,548
[Sound of the seeker’s footsteps]

337
00:22:27,272 --> 00:22:28,847
[SOOBIN]

338
00:22:37,307 --> 00:22:39,121
I’m scared.

339
00:22:39,122 --> 00:22:41,195
Please don’t do this.

340
00:22:42,806 --> 00:22:45,512
[Found you! SOOBIN]

341
00:22:47,283 --> 00:22:49,513
Please don’t do this.

342
00:22:50,479 --> 00:22:52,974
Ah... seriously...

343
00:22:53,710 --> 00:22:56,132
Could you move that face away...

344
00:22:56,566 --> 00:23:01,790
Please move your face away.

345
00:23:07,010 --> 00:23:09,932
[SOOBIN checks the seeker]

346
00:23:19,354 --> 00:23:21,061
Please look forward, not at me.

347
00:23:22,147 --> 00:23:24,228
Please don’t do this.

348
00:23:24,940 --> 00:23:27,334
Okay, I’m going. Okay.

349
00:23:30,851 --> 00:23:32,721
I’m leaving. Don’t look back.

350
00:23:32,722 --> 00:23:34,977
Let’s go.

351
00:23:36,048 --> 00:23:38,445
[SOOBIN]

352
00:23:38,446 --> 00:23:40,622
Hey, over here. Over here.

353
00:23:40,623 --> 00:23:42,088
Huh? What?

354
00:23:42,089 --> 00:23:43,180
Almost everyone’s been caught.

355
00:23:43,371 --> 00:23:44,144
Okay then!

356
00:23:44,145 --> 00:23:45,999
YEONJUN is the survival king.

357
00:23:46,000 --> 00:23:47,981
So YEONJUN is the only one left?

358
00:23:48,148 --> 00:23:50,017
But didn’t we already lose by now?

359
00:23:50,018 --> 00:23:50,902
Yeah, we already lost.

360
00:23:50,903 --> 00:23:52,571
YEONJUN just has to come find the key.

361
00:23:52,572 --> 00:23:54,918
– But there’s probably only one key left.
– Just one.

362
00:23:54,919 --> 00:23:58,136
But imagine if YEONJUN shows up with two keys like a hero.

363
00:23:58,308 --> 00:24:01,060
He’d be the main character of this episode.

364
00:24:01,061 --> 00:24:02,755
And YEONJUN hasn’t been caught even once.

365
00:24:02,990 --> 00:24:04,141
He hasn’t been caught?

366
00:24:04,142 --> 00:24:05,444
I thought I heard him scream earlier.

367
00:24:05,442 --> 00:24:06,824
Oh right, he hasn’t been caught at all.

368
00:24:06,825 --> 00:24:08,277
He was with me earlier.

369
00:24:08,278 --> 00:24:09,691
He screamed and ran away.

370
00:24:09,692 --> 00:24:11,430
I figured he got caught.

371
00:24:11,431 --> 00:24:13,614
But he just looped around and came back.

372
00:24:15,642 --> 00:24:18,883
Go, go, go!

373
00:24:23,547 --> 00:24:26,960
[Seeker / YEONJUN / Seeker]

374
00:24:27,130 --> 00:24:30,611
[The two seekers are looking for YEONJUN]

375
00:24:30,780 --> 00:24:31,946
[YEONJUN]

376
00:24:32,841 --> 00:24:34,007
[YEONJUN]

377
00:24:45,925 --> 00:24:49,150
[The seekers circle near his hiding spot]

378
00:25:00,722 --> 00:25:03,930
[One seeker enters the room YEONJUN is hiding in]

379
00:25:09,405 --> 00:25:11,121
[Sound of them searching the room]

380
00:25:23,122 --> 00:25:26,366
[But the seeker leaves without spotting him]

381
00:25:31,505 --> 00:25:34,947
I didn’t get caught. I didn’t get caught.

382
00:25:34,948 --> 00:25:37,404
They passed right by, and I wasn’t seen.

383
00:25:37,817 --> 00:25:39,671
That’s insane.

384
00:25:41,390 --> 00:25:43,619
Seriously, like...

385
00:25:45,151 --> 00:25:48,992
They came in and didn’t see me.

386
00:25:48,993 --> 00:25:51,221
They came in but didn’t notice.

387
00:25:52,361 --> 00:25:56,296
It’s dark in here, and I was crouched in a corner.

388
00:25:56,992 --> 00:26:00,240
But they didn’t see me.

389
00:26:00,694 --> 00:26:03,601
[20-minute mark notification sound]

390
00:26:07,429 --> 00:26:10,287
[Over 20 minutes in jail / HUENINGKAI can no longer escape]

391
00:26:10,840 --> 00:26:12,273
You guys got caught that fast?

392
00:26:12,679 --> 00:26:13,869
I have 4 minutes left.

393
00:26:13,870 --> 00:26:15,833
I’ve got 11 minutes left.

394
00:26:15,834 --> 00:26:18,458
[HUENINGKAI]

395
00:26:18,759 --> 00:26:21,223
[Phone notification sound]

396
00:26:21,403 --> 00:26:23,556
Soon, only 444 seconds will remain.

397
00:26:23,557 --> 00:26:26,622
Shadows, even faster than the seekers, will begin to move.

398
00:26:26,999 --> 00:26:31,541
If spotted by a shadow, it’ll make a loud sound
to reveal your location. So don’t get caught.

399
00:26:31,542 --> 00:26:34,214
This is way too hard.

400
00:26:34,215 --> 00:26:35,857
If even shadows are moving now...

401
00:26:36,121 --> 00:26:38,713
I don’t think YEONJUN’s heart can handle this.

402
00:26:38,714 --> 00:26:40,209
I don’t think he’ll bring the key to the jail.

403
00:26:40,480 --> 00:26:41,600
But honestly

404
00:26:41,545 --> 00:26:44,241
YEONJUN surviving to the end would be amazing.

405
00:26:46,623 --> 00:26:50,507
[All four keys were used for escape]

406
00:26:53,098 --> 00:26:57,239
[But four members are now in jail with only one key left]

407
00:26:58,698 --> 00:27:02,958
[YEONJUN is still the only one who hasn’t been caught]

408
00:27:07,711 --> 00:27:13,385
[With two seekers and shadows now active during the final 444 seconds]

409
00:27:15,468 --> 00:27:17,212
[YEONJUN]

410
00:27:17,865 --> 00:27:22,486
[Will YEONJUN survive until the end?]

411
00:27:27,310 --> 00:27:30,457
[Shadow activity begins]

412
00:27:30,590 --> 00:27:33,056
[Sound of shadows moving]

413
00:27:35,153 --> 00:27:38,681
[They first enter the 1st floor, where YEONJUN is hiding]

414
00:27:40,104 --> 00:27:42,347
[YEONJUN]

415
00:27:45,763 --> 00:27:47,387
[Time remaining]
Where is he hiding?

416
00:27:47,388 --> 00:27:48,510
What’s with YEONJUN?

417
00:27:48,511 --> 00:27:50,262
YEONJUN hid for so long!

418
00:27:50,263 --> 00:27:51,219
Yeah! He held out for a long time!

419
00:27:51,220 --> 00:27:52,417
Respect.

420
00:27:52,418 --> 00:27:54,184
YEONJUN, you’re the survival king.

421
00:27:58,943 --> 00:28:04,671
[Less than 5 minutes left / The seekers and shadows search for YEONJUN]

422
00:28:08,575 --> 00:28:11,995
[Shadow / YEONJUN /
A shadow moves toward YEONJUN’s hiding spot]

423
00:28:11,996 --> 00:28:15,487
[YEONJUN]

424
00:28:19,745 --> 00:28:23,027
[YEONJUN]

425
00:28:23,205 --> 00:28:24,983
[YEONJUN]

426
00:28:38,197 --> 00:28:41,184
[(Shadow’s POV)]

427
00:28:42,841 --> 00:28:44,975
[YEONJUN screams]

428
00:28:47,362 --> 00:28:50,925
[The shadows finally find YEONJUN]

429
00:28:51,108 --> 00:28:53,431
[The shadow roars]

430
00:28:53,957 --> 00:28:58,771
[Seeker moves after hearing the sound]

431
00:29:01,514 --> 00:29:03,695
Found you! YEONJUN.

432
00:29:06,158 --> 00:29:08,018
Please don’t.

433
00:29:08,019 --> 00:29:10,729
I really held out for so long.

434
00:29:10,730 --> 00:29:14,120
[YEONJUN]

435
00:29:14,330 --> 00:29:18,593
[Hide-and-seek ends]

436
00:29:30,565 --> 00:29:34,269
[Seeker wins]

437
00:29:35,826 --> 00:29:38,227
No!

438
00:29:38,415 --> 00:29:40,057
He lasted so long, so long.

439
00:29:40,251 --> 00:29:41,681
[Phone notification sound]

440
00:29:43,313 --> 00:29:44,401
Hide-and-seek has ended.

441
00:29:44,402 --> 00:29:47,153
All members were caught, resulting in a 0% survival rate.

442
00:29:47,154 --> 00:29:49,415
Snack gift mission failed.

443
00:29:49,536 --> 00:29:51,164
We’ll buy it for you, MOA.

444
00:29:51,165 --> 00:29:52,371
We’ll buy it for you.

445
00:29:52,372 --> 00:29:53,708
Sorry, MOA.

446
00:29:53,914 --> 00:29:54,966
Wow, seriously...

447
00:29:54,967 --> 00:29:56,834
I really held out for a long time...

448
00:29:57,082 --> 00:29:59,461
We wasted too many keys early on.

449
00:29:59,462 --> 00:30:00,675
Even though we found all the keys

450
00:30:00,676 --> 00:30:03,315
we could’ve won if we just kept hiding.

451
00:30:03,564 --> 00:30:05,037
[Seeker’s scream]

452
00:30:08,836 --> 00:30:10,471
What are you doing here?

453
00:30:11,001 --> 00:30:12,753
One more round?
